{%- comment -%}
  Per-product badge from `product.metafields.custom.badge`.

  Set it at import time, e.g. "Most Popular", "New", "Wide fit". Renders nothing
  when the metafield is empty, so it never shows a stale or empty pill.

  COMPLIANCE: a badge is a claim. "Most Popular" and "Best Seller" are only
  allowed once our own sales data supports them — see COMPLIANCE.md. Descriptive
  badges ("Wide fit", "New", "Trim to fit") are always safe.

  Accepts:
  - block: {Object} the main-product block
  - product: {Object}
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign badge = product.metafields.custom.badge | metafield_text | strip
-%}

{%- if badge != blank -%}
  <p class="sw-product-badge" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    <span class="sw-badge">{{ badge }}</span>
  </p>
{%- endif -%}
